            (3, "sorry", "We tell God we are sorry for the times we did not love Him and other people, and we ask Him to forgive us.", True),
            (4, "glory", "On most Sundays we sing a happy song of praise, like the angels sang when Jesus was born. (Not in Advent or Lent.)", False),
            (6, "book", "Time to sit and listen. God talks to us through the Bible. Listen for one word or name you can remember.", True),
            (10, "gospel", "We stand up because now we hear about Jesus Himself. Trace a little cross on your forehead, your lips and your heart: God&rsquo;s word in my mind, on my lips and in my heart.", True),
            (11, "homily", "The priest or deacon helps us understand the readings. Try to find one thing he says that you can do this week.", False),
