            (18, "host", "This is the most important part, so we kneel. The priest says Jesus&rsquo; own words, and the bread and wine become Jesus&rsquo; Body and Blood. Listen for the bells, look at the Host when the priest lifts it up, and whisper, &ldquo;My Lord and my God.&rdquo;", False),
